---
// Política de privacidad de subidor-videos. Cubre lo que piden las Developer
// Policies de YouTube API Services: aviso de que usa YouTube API Services, liga a
// la Google Privacy Policy, qué datos toca, cómo se guardan, cómo se revoca el
// acceso y cómo se borran. En inglés porque la revisa el equipo de YouTube.
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const CONTACT = 'itic.rodrigomg@gmail.com';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy · subidor-videos"
  description="Privacy Policy of subidor-videos, a private tool that uses YouTube API Services."
>
  <section class="container-site legal">
    <header>
      <p class="kicker"><a href="/subidor-videos">subidor-videos</a></p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">
        Effective November 5, 2026 · Applies to <strong>subidor-videos</strong>, operated by
        Rodrigo Ricardo Méndez Gallegos, Camino del Teca 580, Tlajomulco, Jalisco, Mexico.
      </p>
    </header>

    <h2>The essentials</h2>
    <p>
      subidor-videos is a private command line tool that I use to upload my own videos to
      the YouTube channels I own. It runs only on my computer and has no other users.
      <strong>subidor-videos uses YouTube API Services.</strong> It does not sell, share or
      use any data for advertising, profiling or analytics.
    </p>

    <h2>YouTube API Services and Google</h2>
    <p>
      subidor-videos uses YouTube API Services (YouTube Data API v3). When you authorize it
      with your Google Account, Google processes that data under the
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Privacy Policy</a>
      (http://www.google.com/policies/privacy). Use of YouTube is subject to the
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube Terms of Service</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Information accessed and how it is used</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>OAuth authorization:</strong> scopes <code>youtube.upload</code> and
        <code>youtube.readonly</code> for the channel you choose during authorization.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Channel identity:</strong> the authorized channel's ID, title and handle, read
        with <code>channels.list</code> only to confirm that uploads go to the right channel.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Videos you upload:</strong> the video file and the metadata you provide (title,
        description, tags, category, privacy, publish date, thumbnail) are sent to YouTube
        with <code>videos.insert</code> and <code>thumbnails.set</code>.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The tool does not read, collect or store any other YouTube data: no comments,
      analytics, subscribers, playlists or data from other users or channels.
    </p>

    <h2>Information stored</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>OAuth refresh token</strong> and the authorized channel's ID, title and handle,
        stored in a local file on my computer. They are never sent anywhere except to Google
        to obtain access tokens.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Upload log:</strong> date, channel, YouTube video ID, URL and title of each
        video uploaded with the tool, stored in a local file on my computer.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Nothing is stored on any server. No cookies, trackers or third party services are
      used by the tool.
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      No information is shared with, sold to or disclosed to any third party. The only
      recipient is Google, as part of using YouTube API Services.
    </p>

    <h2>Revoking access</h2>
    <p>
      You can revoke subidor-videos' access to your Google Account at any time from the
      Google security settings page:
      <a href="https://security.google.com/settings/security/permissions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://security.google.com/settings/security/permissions</a>.
      After revoking it, the stored refresh token stops working and the tool can no longer
      upload to that channel.
    </p>

    <h2>Deleting your data</h2>
    <p>
      The refresh token and upload log can be deleted at any time by removing the local
      files, which immediately stops all access. To request
      deletion of any data related to your account, write to
      <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a> and it will be deleted within 7 days.
      Videos already uploaded to YouTube are managed and deleted from YouTube Studio.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      If this policy changes, the new version will be published on this page with its
      effective date.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a>
    </p>

    <p class="links">
      <a href="/subidor-videos">subidor-videos</a> ·
      <a href="/subidor-videos/terms">Terms of Service</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 46rem;
    padding-block: 3.5rem 4rem;
  }
  .legal h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.6rem;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.6rem;
  }
  .legal p,
  .legal li {
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .legal ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }
  .legal li + li {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }
  .links {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .muted {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
